Dialogue: 9,0:00:00.63,0:00:02.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing a birthday party.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:02.15,0:00:03.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You should come.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:05.45,0:00:08.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're kinda easy to talk to lately.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:10.24,0:00:11.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well...
Dialogue: 9,0:00:11.36,0:00:13.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I did decide not to lie to you.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:14.82,0:00:16.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:19.34,0:00:20.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:20.67,0:00:22.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:22.07,0:00:23.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.76,0:00:31.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is where I last saw Hinazuki 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:31.88,0:00:34.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Her body was only found\Nafter the snow melted,
Dialogue: 9,0:00:34.73,0:00:39.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}but she went missing sometime in March. What day?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:39.30,0:00:41.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}If I can figure that out, \NI can prevent her kidnapping.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:46.91,0:00:49.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Nakanishi Aya. Sugita Hiromi.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:49.87,0:00:51.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Right, Hiromi was killed, too.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But only Hinazuki was ten years old.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:54.39,0:00:58.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So her birthday hadn't yet passed\Nwhen she went missing in March.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:59.66,0:01:04.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means that X-Day is somewhere\Nbetween March 1st and her birthday.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:40.12,0:02:42.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:42.72,0:02:45.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Apparently the boys are competing in pairs.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:45.20,0:02:47.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:48.48,0:02:51.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I bet Hamada's gonna get the best time.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:51.63,0:02:52.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:54.10,0:02:55.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hamada-kun!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:55.40,0:02:57.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ice hockey team, represent!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:56.11,0:02:57.59,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,Kick some butt, Hamada!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:57.59,0:02:59.92,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,Show 'em who's boss!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:58.45,0:02:59.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Please shut up.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:00.92,0:03:02.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:04.98,0:03:06.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't expect me to go easy on you.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:06.78,0:03:07.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:07.97,0:03:11.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hamada's a starter on the ice hockey team\Nthat won the national championship.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:12.30,0:03:15.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do remember racing him at some point.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:17.77,0:03:19.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma's going up against Hamada.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:19.89,0:03:21.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poor guy.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:21.30,0:03:23.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wish him luck, Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:25.22,0:03:26.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Go on, Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:29.06,0:03:30.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Think you can win, Fujinuma?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:32.46,0:03:33.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll give it my all.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:33.83,0:03:36.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Well, good luck.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:40.27,0:03:41.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,On your marks...
Dialogue: 9,0:03:42.05,0:03:43.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get set...
Dialogue: 9,0:03:45.80,0:03:46.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:50.18,0:03:51.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Satoru!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:51.93,0:03:54.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What're you doing, Hamada?!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:55.22,0:03:56.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:56.69,0:03:58.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma must've jumped the gun.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:01.42,0:04:03.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I really allowed to win?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:03.06,0:04:05.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is there any point to me winning?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:08.70,0:04:11.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This guy does his best and practices hard every day.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:12.54,0:04:14.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's obvious who should win.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:20.29,0:04:21.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Score!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:22.07,0:04:24.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See? Hamada did win in the end.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:26.30,0:04:27.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That was awesome!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:27.64,0:04:30.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru pushed Hamada \Nall the way! That's incredible!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:30.63,0:04:31.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right, Kenya?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:35.89,0:04:37.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:39.10,0:04:41.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I hate punks like you!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:45.28,0:04:46.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:46.90,0:04:47.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That was a close one, huh?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:47.96,0:04:49.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shaddup!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:49.12,0:04:50.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's his deal?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:50.98,0:04:53.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously. Getting mad just 'cause he nearly lost.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:53.12,0:04:54.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:56.99,0:04:57.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remember now.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:00.71,0:05:02.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,I hate punks like you!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:03.43,0:05:07.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I ended up making the same\Nmistake I made 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:16.65,0:05:17.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:19.35,0:05:21.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hamada was too fast for me after all.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:22.80,0:05:24.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:24.03,0:05:24.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 9,0:05:25.22,0:05:27.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When's your birthday?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:31.03,0:05:31.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:35.45,0:05:37.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You said you wouldn't lie to me.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:39.95,0:05:40.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:40.97,0:05:43.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I felt like today was meant to be Hamada's day.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:44.14,0:05:44.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:46.38,0:05:46.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 9,0:05:46.88,0:05:47.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:49.22,0:05:52.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're both fakes and liars.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:58.76,0:06:00.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's head home, Satoru-kun.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:04.27,0:06:06.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I forgot something. Go on ahead!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:28.76,0:06:30.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's up, Satoru?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:30.22,0:06:32.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yashiro-sensei...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:32.30,0:06:33.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,U-Uh...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:35.45,0:06:37.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is this about Kayo?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:37.07,0:06:38.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's got good intuition.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:39.27,0:06:41.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted to know her birthday.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:41.03,0:06:42.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:42.26,0:06:44.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:44.05,0:06:47.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've become good friends with her lately, huh?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:47.41,0:06:49.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:49.19,0:06:51.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You didn't ask her?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:51.17,0:06:54.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I told her when my birthday was,\Nbut she wouldn't tell me hers.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:54.55,0:06:57.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, I get it now.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:57.40,0:06:58.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See for yourself.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:58.98,0:07:00.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What exactly do you "get"?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:02.29,0:07:04.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The same birthday as me?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:04.54,0:07:05.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:06.66,0:07:07.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:07.75,0:07:13.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, Kayo's a bit shy, so she probably found\Nit hard to mention you shared birthdays.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:13.02,0:07:15.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let that get to you, though.\NCelebrate it with her.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:15.67,0:07:17.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Will do.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:17.47,0:07:19.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, goodbye.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:20.50,0:07:21.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:22.89,0:07:24.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Too bad about the race today.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:25.02,0:07:26.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, always give it your all.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:26.59,0:07:28.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The same goes with Kayo, too.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:28.57,0:07:29.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:30.49,0:07:31.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yashiro Gaku.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:32.15,0:07:34.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He must be around my age at this time.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:34.49,0:07:36.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's got a sharp, discerning eye.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:44.69,0:07:46.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I now know when X-Day is.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:48.70,0:07:50.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's March 1st.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:50.84,0:07:52.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}11 days from now.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:54.06,0:07:56.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to make up with Hinazuki first.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:59.93,0:08:01.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? She's not here.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:14.63,0:08:16.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru-kun!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:19.24,0:08:20.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuuki-san!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:23.71,0:08:26.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You seem to have made l-lots of friends.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:26.96,0:08:28.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:28.29,0:08:31.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's 23 years old at this time,
Dialogue: 9,0:08:31.16,0:08:33.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}which means he's younger than me.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:33.42,0:08:35.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I owe it all to you.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:35.34,0:08:36.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, you don't!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:36.51,0:08:40.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I-It's all because y-you worked up the courage.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:40.07,0:08:44.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-When you want to have fun with people,\Nth-they usually get the message.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:45.68,0:08:49.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His stammering and gentle nature\Nare just how I remember. He's a nice guy.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:51.12,0:08:53.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yuuki-san, do you know Hinazuki Kayo?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:53.86,0:08:56.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo-chan? Yeah, I know her.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:56.56,0:08:57.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was quick.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:58.06,0:09:00.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The girl who's always at the park by herself, right?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:00.93,0:09:03.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've talked to her a bunch of times.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:03.18,0:09:05.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you two classmates?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:05.10,0:09:05.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:05.87,0:09:07.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:08.87,0:09:10.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Jun! Let's eat!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:10.95,0:09:12.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You go ahead. I'll eat later.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:12.96,0:09:14.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a bit early for dinner?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:14.94,0:09:16.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We start really early in the morning.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:16.76,0:09:19.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I work at my dad's catering service from 4 a.m.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,4 a.m.? Really?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:21.51,0:09:23.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Only until noon, though.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:23.98,0:09:25.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 9,0:09:25.29,0:09:29.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since I always saw him hanging around in \Nthe afternoon, I just assumed he was unemployed.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:30.27,0:09:36.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that I'm 29, I can tell he's making an effort\Nto use standard Japanese in front of me.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:36.26,0:09:40.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kids tend to find this manner\Nof speech credible and mature.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:41.03,0:09:43.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How did he talk to you?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:43.76,0:09:46.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did it give you the impression he was a nice guy?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:47.33,0:09:51.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They put out a papercraft\Ntournament special recently.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:54.57,0:09:59.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,U-Uh, I-I got those from someone,\Ns-so I couldn't th-throw them away.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:59.69,0:10:02.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:02.60,0:10:06.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,Was there anything in his room\Nthat made you feel uneasy?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:10.20,0:10:12.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I should get going.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:12.52,0:10:13.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:16.91,0:10:20.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru-kun, you've matured quite a bit.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:21.98,0:10:23.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:24.60,0:10:25.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:28.62,0:10:30.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,23,,{\i1}Shiratori Jun.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:30.01,0:10:33.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,23,,{\i1}In May 2006, he's sitting on death row.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:33.65,0:10:36.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,23,,{\i1\q2}He's maintained his innocence ever since the initial hearing.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:39.35,0:10:42.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I really can't believe that \NYuuki-san would murder anyone.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:43.32,0:10:45.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If no crimes take place, there won't be any suspects.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:47.63,0:10:49.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just you wait, Yuuki-san.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:50.31,0:10:51.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I swear I'll...
Dialogue: 9,0:10:56.55,0:10:58.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's still not home?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:04.31,0:11:05.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This place is a mess.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:08.95,0:11:10.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's this?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:11.40,0:11:12.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gloves!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:16.37,0:11:17.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:24.74,0:11:25.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:27.52,0:11:28.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:30.15,0:11:31.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Close the door.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:32.01,0:11:34.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,N-No! If you stay here...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:41.78,0:11:44.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Kayo?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:44.55,0:11:47.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You cooped in here by yourself again?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:47.88,0:11:49.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This bitch...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:49.58,0:11:50.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This bitch!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:54.06,0:11:56.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get in the house, quick.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:05.26,0:12:06.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:06.26,0:12:08.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How did she get those bruises?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:11.52,0:12:13.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tell him, Kayo.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:19.03,0:12:19.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I fell.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:24.79,0:12:29.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I couldn't find the words \Nto respond to Hinazuki's sad lie.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:31.70,0:12:35.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her eyes wouldn't look my way anymore.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:51.06,0:12:53.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kayo. Cool it down!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:57.48,0:13:01.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't get that face \Nof yours healed by Monday,
Dialogue: 9,0:13:01.16,0:13:03.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get all the blame!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:05.46,0:13:06.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:06.85,0:13:08.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Leave some ice for me.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:28.84,0:13:29.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's not here yet.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:35.35,0:13:37.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning, Satoru.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:37.00,0:13:37.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:39.38,0:13:40.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:40.81,0:13:41.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So cold.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:42.97,0:13:44.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here's how you calculate the radius.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:44.64,0:13:47.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The circumference is the diameter multiplied by pi,{literally says 3.14 but eh}{i'm too pedantic for this shit}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:47.80,0:13:50.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,so if you divide by pi instead,\Nyou'll get the diameter,{is this sentence awkwardly long?}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:50.98,0:13:52.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,which you can divide by two...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:54.37,0:13:55.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:57.37,0:13:59.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Take your seat.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:00.13,0:14:02.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All right, who wants to come up here and solve this?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:03.84,0:14:05.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How about you, Satou?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:05.56,0:14:06.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:06.83,0:14:08.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's simple.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:16.31,0:14:18.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're collecting the school lunch money!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:18.97,0:14:21.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,I have to change the future.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:20.43,0:14:21.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Put it in this box.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:22.50,0:14:25.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If you forgot to bring yours today,\Nyou have until tomorrow!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:25.48,0:14:29.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The reason Kayo's often late\Nor absent on Mondays, huh?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:30.03,0:14:31.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you have an idea, Satoru?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:31.78,0:14:35.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Because her mother beats her on Saturdays.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:36.15,0:14:39.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you noticed.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:39.01,0:14:40.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You knew about it?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:40.83,0:14:42.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:42.88,0:14:45.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is it? Tell me!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:45.23,0:14:48.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if I should \Ntell the other students or not.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:48.76,0:14:51.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You know how Kayo's cut off \Nfrom the rest of the class, right?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:51.54,0:14:54.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If they find out she's being abused on top of that,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:54.02,0:14:57.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,everyone might discriminate against her.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:57.01,0:14:58.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:59.40,0:15:01.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, Satoru, I know you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:01.64,0:15:03.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:04.23,0:15:06.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Keep it a secret from the others.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:06.29,0:15:06.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:07.78,0:15:12.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Honestly, we started suspecting \NKayo's mother around May last year.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:12.90,0:15:16.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But as of now, no concrete steps\Nhave been taken to deal with it.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:16.06,0:15:17.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:17.35,0:15:20.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Her mother ends up covering it up well.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:20.80,0:15:24.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The Child Welfare Center has visited\Nthem three times as of last month,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:24.95,0:15:28.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but she has good intuition, because each time they came, she was out with Kayo.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:28.46,0:15:31.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They haven't been able to question them yet.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:31.14,0:15:33.13,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,Useless hacks.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:33.13,0:15:35.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:35.01,0:15:38.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I've met the mother a few times.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:39.19,0:15:41.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo's definitely being abused.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:41.85,0:15:44.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All we need is confirmation\Nfrom the Child Welfare Center.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:44.78,0:15:47.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We'll free Kayo from her mother as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:47.65,0:15:49.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Their preparations are that far along, huh?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:50.40,0:15:53.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But if and when that happens,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:53.63,0:15:56.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo won't be in this class anymore.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:56.81,0:15:59.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,As long as Hinazuki is saved, I don't care.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:59.78,0:16:00.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Sensei.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:02.55,0:16:05.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yashiro must be waiting \Nfor spring break to take action.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:06.92,0:16:08.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it'll be too late by then!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:09.75,0:16:11.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Step on it, damn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:13.26,0:16:14.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sit down already!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:14.47,0:16:16.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:16.84,0:16:19.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The lunch money is gone.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:20.23,0:16:24.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}29 years old and I've gotta \Nget caught up in something like this?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:26.42,0:16:27.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:27.77,0:16:28.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:29.15,0:16:32.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I lost everyone's lunch money.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:35.00,0:16:38.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think he lost it. Somebody must've stolen it.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:39.40,0:16:41.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Like Hinazuki-san, maybe.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:41.81,0:16:43.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait. What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:43.75,0:16:48.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, she hasn't paid for her lunches.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:48.32,0:16:51.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure only someone \Nwho's poor would steal the money.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:51.41,0:16:52.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's probably right!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:52.47,0:16:53.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you take it, Hinazuki?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:54.68,0:16:56.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goddamn brat...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:56.97,0:17:00.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We'll find out once we check everyone's bags.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:00.55,0:17:02.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I agree!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:02.76,0:17:04.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Man, I wanna eat already.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:05.93,0:17:07.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna look{search} for it?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:07.43,0:17:10.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why bother? I didn't take it.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:10.15,0:17:12.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Search your neighbors' bags, too!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:12.61,0:17:14.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You took it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:14.31,0:17:15.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:15.07,0:17:16.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, find the thief!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:17.04,0:17:18.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing here.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:18.11,0:17:19.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be Hinazuki, right?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:19.47,0:17:20.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Obviously!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:20.44,0:17:22.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's poor!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:23.37,0:17:24.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:24.82,0:17:26.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:25.40,0:17:26.54,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,It was someone who's poor!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:26.54,0:17:30.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,See? I was right! Kayo's the thief!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:29.54,0:17:30.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:30.92,0:17:32.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So what if she's poor or starving?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:32.88,0:17:35.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki would never steal from anybody!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:40.01,0:17:41.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I bet it was you.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:43.19,0:17:47.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You know, anybody could've taken it\N from Satoru's desk and planted it there.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:52.33,0:17:57.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Class, Kayo's on duty today, so there's \Nnothing strange about her having the money.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:57.16,0:17:59.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Misato, Satoru. This ends here, okay?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:59.71,0:18:01.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's have lunch.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:03.52,0:18:06.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,School will be closing shortly...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:07.37,0:18:08.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, this is awkward.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:11.36,0:18:13.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for earlier, Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:14.12,0:18:16.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No problem. \NShe was saying some really awful things.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:18.49,0:18:22.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When we were in third grade, \Nshe kept making fun of my pencils.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:22.66,0:18:26.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,so I threw her prized \Nmechanical pencil out the window.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:28.58,0:18:31.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's hated me ever since.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:31.46,0:18:32.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Though the feeling's mutual.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:33.75,0:18:37.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But this one time, \Nshe invited me to a Christmas party.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:38.23,0:18:40.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She just wanted to show off her big Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:42.20,0:18:43.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was so pretty.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:46.43,0:18:47.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remember now.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:49.54,0:18:50.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:51.05,0:18:53.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How about we go see one today?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:53.23,0:18:54.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See what?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:54.64,0:18:55.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:57.62,0:18:58.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:03.38,0:19:03.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:06.35,0:19:07.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They're just cotton gloves.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:08.41,0:19:10.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But we're going up a hill, so it'll be cold.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:12.02,0:19:14.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I never said I'd go.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:21.11,0:19:24.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I used to ski and bobsled here all the time.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:27.85,0:19:29.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I even saw red foxes every now and then.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:37.59,0:19:38.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There they are!{*shine noise*}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:41.09,0:19:43.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Whoa!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:43.03,0:19:45.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remembered the red foxes circling around my feet.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:47.62,0:19:49.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I saw them by myself 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:49.98,0:19:52.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nobody believed me when I told them.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:02.26,0:20:03.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Think they're a couple?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:03.73,0:20:05.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They must be.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:15.06,0:20:16.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm in luck today.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:16.72,0:20:18.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The clouds have cleared up.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:22.00,0:20:23.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:40.35,0:20:41.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Look, it's a Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:42.57,0:20:43.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:45.03,0:20:47.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid? It's February.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:50.19,0:20:52.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's come back here in the summer.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:52.79,0:20:54.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,To see this Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:00.17,0:21:01.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
